</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>XST_SUCCESS, if buffer has non-zero value.</para></listitem><listitem><para>XST_FAILURE, if buffer has all zeroes as values. </para></listitem></itemizedlist>
</para></simplesect>
